=== Modding Changes ===

Specifically, this is the modding diff between Repentance v1.7.9b and Repentance+ v1.9.7.12.J273. Any Repentance+ changes after this patch (if any) are not included in this list.

New classes:
* FontRenderSettings - https://wofsauge.github.io/IsaacDocs/rep/FontRenderSettings.html

New class members:
* void Entity:KillWithSource(EntityRef Source)
* boolean GridEntity:DestroyWithSource(boolean Immediate, EntityRef Source)
* boolean GridEntity:HurtWithSource(int Damage, EntityRef Source)
* int Options.JacobEsauControls (0 = classic, 1 = better)
* boolean Room:DamageGridWithSource(int Index, int Damage, EntityRef Source)
* boolean Room:DestroyGridWithSource(int Index, boolean Immediate, EntityRef Source)

Changed class methods:
* Entity:AddBurn - Added optional "IgnoreBosses" parameter.
* Entity:AddCharmed - Added optional "IgnoreBosses" parameter.
* Entity:AddFear - Added optional "IgnoreBosses" parameter.
* Entity:AddFreeze - Added optional "IgnoreBosses" parameter.
* Entity:AddMidasFreeze - Added optional "IgnoreBosses" parameter.
* Entity:AddPoison - Added optional "IgnoreBosses" parameter.
* Entity:AddShrink - Added optional "IgnoreBosses" parameter.
* Entity:AddSlowing - Added optional "IgnoreBosses" parameter.
* EntityPlayer:AddCollectible - Added optional "ItemPoolType" parameter.
* Game:Fadein - Added optional "ShowIcon" and "KColor" parameters.
* Game:Fadeout - Added optional "KColor" parameter.
* HUD:ShowItemText - Added optional "StackUpText" boolean parameter. If it is missing or true, then it clears the message stack (Repentance functionality). If it is false, then the text will stack up (Repentance+ functionality). These values are counterintuitive, so it seems likely that the developers made a mistake.
* Room:MamaMegaExplosion - Made the "Position" parameter optional. Added optional "Player" parameter.
* Font:DrawString - Added an overload with the following signature: void (string String, float PositionX, float PositionY, float sizeX, float sizeY, KColor RenderColor, FontRenderSettings settings)

New enums:
* DrawStringAlignment - https://wofsauge.github.io/IsaacDocs/rep/enums/DrawStringAlignment.html

New enum members:
* BackdropType.DEATHMATCH = 61
* BackdropType.LIL_PORTAL = 62
* ButtonAction.ACTION_MENULB = 24 (took over old value of ACTION_MENULT)
* ButtonAction.ACTION_MENURB = 25 (took over old value of ACTION_MENURT)
* ButtonAction.ACTION_MENUEX = 29
* ButtonAction.ACTION_EMOTES = 30

Changed enum members:
* ButtonAction.ACTION_FULLSCREEN = 16 (changed from 17)
* ButtonAction.ACTION_MUTE = 17 (changed from 18)
* ButtonAction.ACTION_RESTART = 18 (changed from 16)
* ButtonAction.ACTION_MENULT = 26 (changed from 24)
* ButtonAction.ACTION_MENURT = 27 (changed from 25)
* ButtonAction.ACTION_MENUTAB = 28 (changed from 26)
* ButtonAction.ACTION_CONSOLE = 32 (changed from 28)

New variables:
* REPENTANCE_PLUS (to determine if the mod is running in Repentance+)

